      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Provider: Auth0**\n\nI've decided on Auth0 as the specific external provider for the federated user profile claims. I'll need to make this choice explicit within the `profile_claims.py` file to ensure the code's functionality is directly linked to Auth0's specific API and data structures. This seems like a good first concrete step.\n\n\n**Specifying Provider: Auth0**\n\nI've specified Auth0 as the external provider, making it explicit. My next step will be to create the `profile_claims.py` file, incorporating a function that simulates Auth0 claim retrieval and normalization, using variable names and comments to reinforce the Auth0 connection. I am confident in this direction.\n\n\n",
